entry: hyprland.conf
Path mapping: ~/.config/hypr -> .   (every source= is `~/.config/hypr/...`).
The tree also contains the upstream .lua port of every .conf at the same commit
(hyprland.lua, conf/*.lua) - reference only, not part of the hyprlang input.
colors.conf is normally regenerated by matugen/wallust templates; shipped default kept.
The `conf/<topic>.conf` files are 1-line indirections that source `conf/<topic>s/<variant>.conf`
(the ML4W settings app rewrites those lines to switch variants).
